        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Parallel Arm Mount Bracket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with Global Door Controls TC200 series and TC2200 series with <a href=\"/products/regular-door-closer-arm-global-ra-1240\"><b>Standard Closer Arm</b></a>. Can be used with any surface mounted closer where the arm Shoe has a 1-3/4\" Center to Center hole pattern.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/hold-open-arm-parallel-mount-bracket-global-ho-pab-1245\"><b>Hold Open Arm Parallel Mount Bracket</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global PAB-1245 Parallel Arm Mount Bracket\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n <li>Width at Header Mount: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n <li>Shoe Mount Holes: 1-3/4\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>1/8\" Thick Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued. </b> Use <a href=\"/products/parallel-arm-mount-bracket-pin-mount-global-pab-2200\"><b>Global PAB-2200 Parallel Mount Bracket</b></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
